#: omake:omake_A2FF9A6B_18A3_4A73_BAE5_F42A9D76E951
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1da94eacf484bdf613409429f9929aece151fd702103c724fddb3559ccda90d5
